# Home

[wireguard]
interface: listen 51820, address 10.100.0.1/16
peer Cabin: key ReplaceCabinPublicKeyAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA=, allowed [10.100.0.2/32, 192.168.2.0/24], routed, endpoint 203.0.113.20:51820
peer Phone: key ReplacePhonePublicKeyAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA=, allowed [10.100.0.100/32]
peer Home.lte-cam: key ReplaceLteCamPublicKeyAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA=, allowed [10.100.10.10/32]

[firewall]
mesh zone: input drop, output accept, forward drop
accept in Home ssh: tcp/22 from [10.100.0.100/32, 192.168.1.50/32] to [10.100.0.1/32, 192.168.1.1/32]
accept in Home.nas https: tcp/443 from [10.100.0.100/32] to [192.168.1.20/32]
accept in Home.printer print: tcp/9100 from [10.100.0.100/32] to [192.168.1.16/32]
accept in Home.lte-cam rtsp: tcp/554 from [10.100.0.100/32, 192.168.1.50/32] to [10.100.10.10/32]
accept out Cabin.camera rtsp: tcp/554 from [192.168.1.50/32] to [192.168.2.30/32]
forward Home.nas https: wan tcp/8443 from [198.51.100.0/24] to lan 192.168.1.20:443

[dhcp]
lease Home.nas: 192.168.1.20 for [aa:bb:cc:00:00:03]
lease Home.printer: 192.168.1.16 for [aa:bb:cc:00:00:02]
lease Phone: 192.168.1.50 for [aa:bb:cc:00:00:01]
